{"2305770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PLUNKO: Champion of the Roundlands", "steam_appid": 2305770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yo! What's up? My name is <strong>PLUNKO</strong>. I am the Champion of the Roundlands. I live in Roundlandia, the capital of the Roundlands. Lord Orb, our mayor, announced a tournament to become the champion. I climbed my way to the top by sheer skill and precision! Now that I am the Champion! I need to stop <strong>King Trungle</strong> from destroying my home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/e58f98bd5fc9345942f758e0d9b573c1.apng?t=1780703676\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/e58f98bd5fc9345942f758e0d9b573c1.poster.avif?t=1780703676\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the Wizard, I have three groovy drinks to choose from to aid me on my quest!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENRG Drink: Bounce off walls and speedrun levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp Shooter Cola: Rootin' Tootin' cola that lets you shoot bullets from your fingertips! (Neat.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healthy Tea: Replenished health to keep you goin!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/98d42072a176290a5e50e41835c24a63.apng?t=1780703676\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/98d42072a176290a5e50e41835c24a63.poster.avif?t=1780703676\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet Geo </strong>is filled with colorful and vibrant levels packed with challenges and secrets. Fight through four worlds; The Roundlands, The Sand Dunes, The Slime Cave, and The Polygon Valley. Each featuring new enemies and bosses to defeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/a0d30f17a1bf488242cf47b78a7acb99.poster.avif?t=1780703676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/a0d30f17a1bf488242cf47b78a7acb99.webm?t=1780703676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speaking of enemies, let me introduce you to the bullies that want to destroy my home. From the left we have the <strong>Octungos</strong>, they're very similar to us, but they're pointy. They think they're better than us because of that. Silly. Then we have the <strong>Squngos</strong>, they are slime cubes that love to spit at everyone they hate. Then we have the <strong>Pentungos</strong>, they fly around and will dash towards you, even if it means death! Finally, the <strong>Trungos</strong>, they are mostly harmless until you touch them or fall on them. They have pointy spikes that stick out! Ouch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boot up &quot;Plunko: Champion of the Roundlands&quot; and become the hero the Roundlands need! Ready to roll?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/579522c871e7bc17d76c711e8620744f.apng?t=1780703676\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/579522c871e7bc17d76c711e8620744f.poster.avif?t=1780703676\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p>", "a